:"https://secure-content.meetupstatic.com/images/classic-member/"},"Member:410116074":{"__typename":"Member","id":"410116074","name":"Andrew Nablo","memberPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:326347597"}},"PhotoInfo:312198476":{"__typename":"PhotoInfo","id":"312198476","highResUrl":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/member/4/8/2/c/highres_312198476.jpeg","baseUrl":"https://secure-content.meetupstatic.com/images/classic-member/"},"Member:192019062":{"__typename":"Member","id":"192019062","name":"Rina","memberPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:312198476"}},"Event:316693116":{"__typename":"Event","id":"316693116","title":"Ghosts of West Toronto - Halloween Event 2026","dateTime":"2026-10-25T18:30:00-04:00","description":"\\*\\***The Toronto History Walks Yearly Pass is available. Get it now for $125.00 for 1 year of unlimited tours, email**\n**torontohistorywalks@gmail.com**\n**for more information or for signing up!\\*\\***\n\n\\*\\* **Please note: Please e-transfer the ticket price when booking your space for this tour! You can e-transfer to the following email at:**\n**torontohistorywalks@gmail.com**\n\nHalloween is the best time to take in the ghosts that haunt our minds and our city. The city is not quite asleep yet and things roam. They cross our paths with the stories we tell. At the core of this tour, two brutal stories that have impacted Toronto, are explored, but have a ghostly following. You could say this tour explores the old stories that stir the blood, even after 150 years.\n\nToronto is not a squeaky clean polished town, it has plenty to chill the blood. Stories of horror and crime and things that go bump in the night abound.\n\nFrom the true horror of the Mercer Reformatory to the Central Prison in Liberty Village, and the ghosts of the exhibition grounds, things that should be left alone will be dug up.\n\nMany other unexplained happenings will be talked about, this tour will haunt, or at least you hope so! Well let's get through this one alive.\n\nThis walking tour is for all levels and walkers. The tour begins at the TTC Exhibition Streetcar loop at the corner of Dufferin Street, and Springhurst Avenue in Parkdale.\n\nThis tour has a ticket price of $15.00 per person.\n\nHope to see you there. And at the end of the tour hopefully you are still around. Well maybe.....\n\n\\*\\* **Please note: Please e-transfer the ticket price when booking your space for this tour! You can e-transfer to the following email at:**\n**torontohistorywalks@gmail.com**","eventType":"PHYSICAL","eventUrl":"https://www.meetup.com/the-history-of-parkdale/events/316693116/","isAttending":false,"isSaved":false,"maxTickets":30,"rsvpState":"JOIN_OPEN","featuredEventPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:515700868"},"displayPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:515700868"},"feeSettings":{"__typename":"EventFeeSettings","accepts":"CASH","currency":"CAD","amount":15},"group":{"__ref":"Group:32429186"},"socialProofInsights":null,"rsvps":{"__typename":"RsvpConnection","totalCount":6,"edges":[{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":true,"member":{"__ref":"Member:284801355"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:408198224"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:4946354"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:410116074"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:192019062"}}}]},"series":null,"venue":{"__typename":"Venue","name":"Dufferin Gate Loop","address":"160-162 Dufferin Street","city":"Toronto","state":"on","country":"ca"}},"RecommendedEventsEdge:{\"node\":{\"id\":\"316693116\"}}":{"__typename":"RecommendedEventsEdge","node":{"__ref":"Event:316693116","id":"316693116"},"metadata":{"__typename":"SearchMetadata","recId":"6b2966c4-319b-40c6-a25e-28c574b33e2a","recSource":"ml-popular-events-nearby-offline"}},"PhotoInfo:448771132":{"__typ